"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[17852],{17852:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n\\n<center>\\n<RestaurantCard\\n  cover=\\"/assets/snippets/location/154a490243e3a9cd6846bd7485feefe8.jpg\\"\\n  title=\\"Life Tonkatsu Head Office\\"\\n  cuisine=\\"Restaurant\\"\\n  address=\\"1st Floor, Life Tonkatsu Head Office, 14-13, Dongtangonwon-ro 3-gil, Dongtan-gu, Hwaseong-si, Gyeonggi-do\\"\\n  rating=3.5\\n  tags=\\"restaurant\\"\\n/>\\n</center>\\n\\n## Ordered\\n\\n```menu\\n{\\n\\"title\\": \\"Signature Tonkatsu\\",\\n\\"rating\\": 4.0\\n}\\n---\\nA classic-style tonkatsu, but with a sauce that feels slightly richer than expected.\\n```\\n```menu\\n{\\n\\"title\\": \\"Spicy Tonkatsu\\",\\n\\"rating\\": 4.0\\n}\\n---\\nSpicy tonkatsu featuring an impressive bean sprout topping, filled with smoky flavor and not as spicy as expected.\\n```\\n## Review\\nI suddenly craved <mark>tonkatsu</mark>, so I visited `Life Tonkatsu Head Office` which I had kept an eye on.  \\n\\nSince it was the weekend and the neighborhood is always crowded, I searched beforehand to see if there was a separate reservation platform.  \\nThere was no separate reservation platform; it was a system of writing on a `waiting list` on-site.  \\n\\nI went there unprepared but prepared to wait long, but fortunately there was no queue.  \\nSeeing that a waiting list had already been filled out, it seemed we visited at a good time, avoiding the peak hours.  \\n```adcard\\n```\\nSince it was our first visit, I felt we absolutely had to order the <mark>Signature Tonkatsu</mark>, and I spent a long time debating what to order for the other dish.  \\nLooking at the menu, which featured various toppings and sauces, there were many items that made me curious about their flavors, so the decision took a while.  \\n\\nAfter careful consideration, we ordered the <mark>Spicy Tonkatsu at the standard Shin Ramyun spiciness level</mark>.  \\n```adcard\\n```\\nThe dishes came out not long after.  \\nThe `Signature Tonkatsu` was in the classic Korean style, but the sauce felt a bit richer than I had expected.  \\n\\nThe `Spicy Tonkatsu` featured an impressive <mark>bean sprout</mark> topping.  \\nIt had a strong smoky flavor and wasn\'t too spicy, making it go very well with rice.  \\n\\nPersonally, while the basic tonkatsu was good, it is a place that makes me curious about how the other tonkatsu dishes with various toppings would taste next time.  \\n\\nInterestingly, they also had `Jjamppong` on the menu, and seeing the next table ordering it along with the tonkatsu made it look quite delicious.  \\nIf I get the chance, it would be nice to order Jjamppong as well.  \\n\\n## Pictures\\n\\n<pictures>\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/154a490243e3a9cd6846bd7485feefe8.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Life Tonkatsu Head Office\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/d1dbf82caee8147373084f9a1ebafbbd.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Life Tonkatsu Head Office\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/f46bc8b8d7d87e398e666fdb2a6d0c69.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Life Tonkatsu Head Office\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/bcba9e47d508ba0dc9b176dc79456690.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Life Tonkatsu Head Office\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/311468ced60b5b64f69da0591778a3bb.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Life Tonkatsu Head Office\\">\\n</pictures>\\n"}')}}]);